[
{
"i": 0,
"t0": 0.29,
"t1": 0.93,
"text": "Monday morning."
},
{
"i": 1,
"t0": 0.93,
"t1": 2.14,
"text": "You sit through a lecture once."
},
{
"i": 2,
"t0": 2.46,
"t1": 3.77,
"text": "You keep every word."
},
{
"i": 3,
"t0": 4.24,
"t1": 5.61,
"text": "Even the professor’s cough..."
},
{
"i": 4,
"t0": 5.82,
"t1": 6.68,
"text": "at minute three."
},
{
"i": 5,
"t0": 7.46,
"t1": 9.32,
"text": "Your friend Ben asks about the notes."
},
{
"i": 6,
"t0": 9.77,
"t1": 10.44,
"text": "You recite them."
},
{
"i": 7,
"t0": 10.84,
"t1": 11.74,
"text": "Page by page."
},
{
"i": 8,
"t0": 11.74,
"t1": 13.98,
"text": "Then you reach your front door."
},
{
"i": 9,
"t0": 14.49,
"t1": 15.68,
"text": "Where are your keys?"
},
{
"i": 10,
"t0": 16.15,
"t1": 16.72,
"text": "In your hand."
},
{
"i": 11,
"t0": 17.19,
"t1": 19.17,
"text": "Where they’ve been..."
},
{
"i": 12,
"t0": 19.92,
"t1": 20.6,
"text": "for ten minutes."
},
{
"i": 13,
"t0": 20.6,
"t1": 22.74,
"text": "Most people hold about four things in mind at once."
},
{
"i": 14,
"t0": 23.16,
"t1": 23.74,
"text": "Maybe seven."
},
{
"i": 15,
"t0": 24.08,
"t1": 25.64,
"text": "Scientists still argue about which."
},
{
"i": 16,
"t0": 26.09,
"t1": 26.68,
"text": "That’s tiny."
},
{
"i": 17,
"t0": 26.68,
"t1": 26.87,
"text": "You?"
},
{
"i": 18,
"t0": 27.52,
"t1": 30.3,
"text": "A memory the size of one million books."
},
{
"i": 19,
"t0": 30.3,
"t1": 31.19,
"text": "And one rule."
},
{
"i": 20,
"t0": 31.52,
"t1": 33.73,
"text": "You can never forget..."
},
{
"i": 21,
"t0": 34.28,
"t1": 34.72,
"text": "anything."
},
{
"i": 22,
"t0": 35.25,
"t1": 38.02,
"text": "So what if your memory held a million books?"
},
{
"i": 23,
"t0": 38.76,
"t1": 39.13,
"text": "Day one."
},
{
"i": 24,
"t0": 39.5,
"t1": 40.6,
"text": "You glance at a phone number."
},
{
"i": 25,
"t0": 40.93,
"t1": 41.59,
"text": "It sticks."
},
{
"i": 26,
"t0": 42.14,
"t1": 44.07,
"text": "You skim a textbook in two minutes."
},
{
"i": 27,
"t0": 44.47,
"t1": 45.54,
"text": "Then you teach it."
},
{
"i": 28,
"t0": 45.76,
"t1": 47.66,
"text": "Ben orders pizza for twelve friends."
},
{
"i": 29,
"t0": 47.91,
"t1": 48.5,
"text": "One time."
},
{
"i": 30,
"t0": 48.86,
"t1": 50.36,
"text": "You repeat the whole order."
},
{
"i": 31,
"t0": 50.78,
"t1": 51.3,
"text": "Perfectly."
},
{
"i": 32,
"t0": 51.79,
"t1": 52.77,
"text": "The waiter applauds."
},
{
"i": 33,
"t0": 53.41,
"t1": 55.69,
"text": "In exams, you write every page you studied."
},
{
"i": 34,
"t0": 56.0,
"t1": 57.32,
"text": "Even where the commas sit."
},
{
"i": 35,
"t0": 57.89,
"t1": 60.32,
"text": "A million books is about eighty billion words."
},
{
"i": 36,
"t0": 60.81,
"t1": 63.15,
"text": "Reading that would take roughly six hundred years."
},
{
"i": 37,
"t0": 63.41,
"t1": 64.19,
"text": "Without sleep."
},
{
"i": 38,
"t0": 64.51,
"t1": 65.58,
"text": "That’s a rough estimate."
},
{
"i": 39,
"t0": 65.86,
"t1": 67.0,
"text": "Your head holds it all."
},
{
"i": 40,
"t0": 67.64,
"t1": 71.14,
"text": "Most people forget much of what they learn within days."
},
{
"i": 41,
"t0": 71.14,
"t1": 74.02,
"text": "Hermann Ebbinghaus showed that back in 1885."
},
{
"i": 42,
"t0": 74.02,
"t1": 74.26,
"text": "You?"
},
{
"i": 43,
"t0": 74.73,
"t1": 75.52,
"text": "Nothing slips."
},
{
"i": 44,
"t0": 75.91,
"t1": 78.99,
"text": "In one week, you memorize three medical textbooks."
},
{
"i": 45,
"t0": 79.32,
"t1": 80.46,
"text": "Ben says you’re not a person."
},
{
"i": 46,
"t0": 80.75,
"t1": 81.9,
"text": "You’re a library..."
},
{
"i": 47,
"t0": 81.9,
"t1": 82.26,
"text": "on legs."
},
{
"i": 48,
"t0": 82.79,
"t1": 84.8,
"text": "Universities start calling."
},
{
"i": 49,
"t0": 84.8,
"t1": 86.65,
"text": "Thirty offers in one month."
},
{
"i": 50,
"t0": 87.07,
"t1": 88.91,
"text": "But the price arrives quietly."
},
{
"i": 51,
"t0": 89.41,
"t1": 90.91,
"text": "Your mind never filters."
},
{
"i": 52,
"t0": 91.24,
"t1": 93.17,
"text": "Every old embarrassment returns..."
},
{
"i": 53,
"t0": 93.52,
"t1": 94.92,
"text": "as if it happened this morning."
},
{
"i": 54,
"t0": 95.18,
"t1": 96.16,
"text": "Every cruel word."
},
{
"i": 55,
"t0": 96.46,
"t1": 97.25,
"text": "Same tone."
},
{
"i": 56,
"t0": 97.61,
"t1": 98.76,
"text": "Sleep slips away."
},
{
"i": 57,
"t0": 99.26,
"t1": 101.32,
"text": "Your brain is two percent of your weight."
},
{
"i": 58,
"t0": 101.7,
"t1": 104.47,
"text": "Yet it burns about twenty percent of your energy."
},
{
"i": 59,
"t0": 104.7,
"t1": 105.6,
"text": "Now it never rests."
},
{
"i": 60,
"t0": 106.06,
"t1": 111.03,
"text": "Psychologist Alexander Luria once studied a man with a famous memory for about thirty years."
},
{
"i": 61,
"t0": 111.44,
"t1": 113.07,
"text": "His memories crowded each other."
},
{
"i": 62,
"t0": 113.5,
"t1": 115.43,
"text": "Abstract ideas got harder."
},
{
"i": 63,
"t0": 115.81,
"t1": 119.81,
"text": "Doctor Hale, your neuroscientist, says something you don’t yet understand."
},
{
"i": 64,
"t0": 120.34,
"t1": 122.39,
"text": "Forgetting isn’t a flaw in the mind..."
},
{
"i": 65,
"t0": 122.66,
"t1": 123.38,
"text": "it’s a mercy."
},
{
"i": 66,
"t0": 124.13,
"t1": 126.77,
"text": "Grandma Rose waters her mint on the balcony."
},
{
"i": 67,
"t0": 126.77,
"t1": 128.01,
"text": "She hums a short tune."
},
{
"i": 68,
"t0": 128.5,
"t1": 129.89,
"text": "You’ve known it since childhood."
},
{
"i": 69,
"t0": 130.33,
"t1": 131.75,
"text": "Lately she forgets names."
},
{
"i": 70,
"t0": 132.24,
"t1": 134.11,
"text": "She calls you by your mother’s name."
},
{
"i": 71,
"t0": 134.74,
"t1": 136.52,
"text": "One Friday she asks who you are."
},
{
"i": 72,
"t0": 137.15,
"t1": 137.95,
"text": "You answer gently."
},
{
"i": 73,
"t0": 138.7,
"t1": 139.57,
"text": "Then she asks again."
},
{
"i": 74,
"t0": 140.26,
"t1": 142.26,
"text": "You promise to remember everything for her."
},
{
"i": 75,
"t0": 142.91,
"t1": 143.29,
"text": "You do."
},
{
"i": 76,
"t0": 144.0,
"t1": 144.56,
"text": "She doesn’t."
},
{
"i": 77,
"t0": 145.23,
"t1": 146.89,
"text": "The National Memory Championship."
},
{
"i": 78,
"t0": 147.39,
"t1": 148.19,
"text": "You’re on stage."
},
{
"i": 79,
"t0": 148.59,
"t1": 149.49,
"text": "Three minutes left."
},
{
"i": 80,
"t0": 150.0,
"t1": 150.91,
"text": "Then thirty seconds."
},
{
"i": 81,
"t0": 151.44,
"t1": 152.45,
"text": "The lights are hot."
},
{
"i": 82,
"t0": 152.8,
"t1": 153.76,
"text": "The room is silent."
},
{
"i": 83,
"t0": 154.47,
"t1": 156.25,
"text": "You recite hundreds of lines."
},
{
"i": 84,
"t0": 156.9,
"t1": 157.36,
"text": "Easily."
},
{
"i": 85,
"t0": 157.82,
"t1": 159.43,
"text": "Then your phone buzzes..."
},
{
"i": 86,
"t0": 159.71,
"t1": 159.97,
"text": "Ben."
},
{
"i": 87,
"t0": 160.54,
"t1": 161.77,
"text": "Grandma is in hospital."
},
{
"i": 88,
"t0": 162.59,
"t1": 163.71,
"text": "Her fear floods back."
},
{
"i": 89,
"t0": 163.93,
"t1": 164.6,
"text": "Her confusion."
},
{
"i": 90,
"t0": 164.93,
"t1": 166.09,
"text": "Her shaking voice."
},
{
"i": 91,
"t0": 166.5,
"t1": 167.39,
"text": "You can’t forget it."
},
{
"i": 92,
"t0": 168.23,
"t1": 169.7,
"text": "Your power stores everything."
},
{
"i": 93,
"t0": 170.12,
"t1": 170.87,
"text": "It can’t calm."
},
{
"i": 94,
"t0": 171.11,
"t1": 171.91,
"text": "It can’t erase."
},
{
"i": 95,
"t0": 172.17,
"t1": 174.11,
"text": "It can’t rebuild someone else’s memory."
},
{
"i": 96,
"t0": 174.9,
"t1": 175.63,
"text": "Finish and win?"
},
{
"i": 97,
"t0": 176.25,
"t1": 176.75,
"text": "Or go to her?"
},
{
"i": 98,
"t0": 177.48,
"t1": 178.84,
"text": "You leave the stage."
},
{
"i": 99,
"t0": 178.84,
"t1": 179.35,
"text": "You run."
},
{
"i": 100,
"t0": 179.89,
"t1": 181.66,
"text": "At her bed, you hold her hand."
},
{
"i": 101,
"t0": 182.25,
"t1": 183.46,
"text": "You hum the mint tune..."
},
{
"i": 102,
"t0": 184.22,
"t1": 185.25,
"text": "exactly as you heard it."
},
{
"i": 103,
"t0": 185.85,
"t1": 186.47,
"text": "She smiles."
},
{
"i": 104,
"t0": 187.18,
"t1": 188.77,
"text": "Then she says your name."
},
{
"i": 105,
"t0": 188.77,
"t1": 189.11,
"text": "Maya."
},
{
"i": 106,
"t0": 189.62,
"t1": 190.71,
"text": "First time in months."
},
{
"i": 107,
"t0": 191.45,
"t1": 192.56,
"text": "That memory will stay."
},
{
"i": 108,
"t0": 193.33,
"t1": 194.48,
"text": "And you finally get it."
},
{
"i": 109,
"t0": 195.04,
"t1": 196.18,
"text": "Your memory isn’t a burden."
},
{
"i": 110,
"t0": 196.7,
"t1": 197.96,
"text": "It’s a gift..."
},
{
"i": 111,
"t0": 197.96,
"t1": 198.59,
"text": "to share."
},
{
"i": 112,
"t0": 199.19,
"t1": 201.04,
"text": "Forgetting isn’t a flaw in the mind..."
},
{
"i": 113,
"t0": 201.75,
"t1": 202.39,
"text": "it’s a mercy."
},
{
"i": 114,
"t0": 203.25,
"t1": 203.89,
"text": "So what’s real?"
},
{
"i": 115,
"t0": 204.58,
"t1": 209.18,
"text": "In 2006, scientists described a woman who recalls her life in rare detail."
},
{
"i": 116,
"t0": 209.44,
"t1": 210.45,
"text": "But a million books?"
},
{
"i": 117,
"t0": 210.83,
"t1": 211.43,
"text": "Impossible."
},
{
"i": 118,
"t0": 212.05,
"t1": 215.83,
"text": "In 1942, Jorge Luis Borges wrote about a man who couldn’t forget."
},
{
"i": 119,
"t0": 216.25,
"t1": 217.67,
"text": "He drowned in detail."
},
{
"i": 120,
"t0": 218.23,
"t1": 220.38,
"text": "Some researchers say forgetting helps us focus."
},
{
"i": 121,
"t0": 220.84,
"t1": 221.51,
"text": "That’s still debated."
},
{
"i": 122,
"t0": 222.19,
"t1": 223.92,
"text": "And sleep locks in what you learn."
},
{
"i": 123,
"t0": 224.4,
"t1": 226.06,
"text": "So never trade it for an exam."
},
{
"i": 124,
"t0": 226.06,
"t1": 227.14,
"text": "That night..."
},
{
"i": 125,
"t0": 227.75,
"t1": 228.55,
"text": "you can’t sleep."
},
{
"i": 126,
"t0": 229.26,
"t1": 231.74,
"text": "So what if one hour of sleep felt like eight?"
},
{
"i": 127,
"t0": 231.74,
"t1": 232.73,
"text": "What do you think?"
},
{
"i": 128,
"t0": 233.3,
"t1": 236.61,
"text": "Tell us in the comments, and tell us which human ability we should do next."
},
{
"i": 129,
"t0": 237.02,
"t1": 238.66,
"text": "Hit like, and subscribe for more."
}
]